<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan weekly forex reserves rise to $1.553 bln.</title>
<headline>Pakistan weekly forex reserves rise to $1.553 bln.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly foreign exchange reserves in Pakistan:</p>
<p>    (BLN DLRS)		April 12   April 5  April 11, 1996</p>
<p>TOTAL			   1.553	1.528    2.297</p>
<p>Forex in Pakistan	   0.555	0.530    1.441</p>
<p>Forex outside Pakistan    0.320	0.320    0.144</p>
<p>Gold coins and bullion    0.676	0.676    0.700</p>
<p>Special Drawing Rights    0.002	0.002    0.012</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
